        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Accents St. Annes Lever</b>\r\n<p>With its dramatic lines and concealed screws, the St. Annes will add exquisite beauty to your home's decor. The universal latch will fit either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. It will fit standard door cut-outs. </p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage levers, you safeguard your home and your family as well as your peace of mind. This Schlage lever will never tarnish, discolor, or corrode. The wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough, just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the St. Annes Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</li>\r\n<li>Limited lifetime finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Available in 9 finishes.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage St. Annes Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><B>Single Dummy:</b> Non-latching and non-locking, these non-functional door levers are usually used as an inactive pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need to be locked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need to be locked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</B> Use when a lock operated by a key is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other St. Annes Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
