                "description": "Schlage St. Annes Lever - With its dramatic lines and concealed screws, the St. Annes will add exquisite beauty to your home's decor. The universal latch will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit standard door cut-outs. ",
